    "brief": "The layout manager used by [`Overlay`](xref:gtk:Gtk.Overlay).",
    "file": "gtk/gtkoverlaylayout.c",
    "line": 33,
    "md": "The layout manager used by [`Overlay`](xref:gtk:Gtk.Overlay).\n\nIt places widgets as overlays on top of the main child.\n\nThis is not a reusable layout manager, since it expects its widget\nto be a `GtkOverlay`. It is only listed here so that its layout\nproperties get documented."
  },
